{
  "v": 2,
  "order": 515,
  "label": "Budget allocator: value-weighted spend",
  "group": "Worked examples",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "note",
      "type": "NoteNode",
      "x": -80,
      "y": -360,
      "init": {
        "label": "Budget Allocator",
        "body": "# Spend by what you value\nEach thing you're buying has a price **range** (a floor and a ceiling) and a **weight** for how much you value it. The **Budget Allocator** splits your money to match.\n\n**Fit budget** spends the whole budget in proportion to the weights, kept inside every range. When a category hits its ceiling, the slack flows to the rest.\n\nHere: a 100,000 budget over five categories. Housing is valued 3x, so it takes the biggest share; Tech and Travel fill to their small caps, and the rest splits by weight.\n\nThe allocator itself stays lean: it returns the **Allocation** and each category's **Share** of the spend. Downstream, a **Join** pulls the price range back in and a **Computed Column** works out the **Headroom** left under each ceiling.\n\nTwo more modes on the card: **Min for target** (the least spend that reaches a value goal) and **Min proportional** (the least spend that keeps the weighting). No solver, just arithmetic.",
        "color": "teal",
        "width": 400,
        "height": 380
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "items",
      "type": "FrameInputNode",
      "x": -80,
      "y": 120,
      "init": {
        "label": "Budget items",
        "frameText": "[{\"name\":\"Category\",\"type\":\"string\",\"values\":[\"Car\",\"Housing\",\"Furniture\",\"Tech\",\"Travel\"]},{\"name\":\"Min\",\"type\":\"number\",\"values\":[20000,15000,3000,2000,1000]},{\"name\":\"Max\",\"type\":\"number\",\"values\":[50000,60000,15000,12000,10000]},{\"name\":\"Weight\",\"type\":\"number\",\"values\":[2,3,1,1,1]}]"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "alloc",
      "type": "BudgetAllocatorNode",
      "x": 360,
      "y": 140,
      "init": {
        "label": "Budget Allocator",
        "mode": "budget"
      },
      "literals": {
        "amount": 100000
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "join",
      "type": "JoinNode",
      "x": 740,
      "y": 40,
      "init": {
        "label": "Join the price range back in",
        "how": "left"
      },
      "stringLiterals": {
        "leftKey": "Category",
        "rightKey": "Category"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hd",
